 "name_zh": "晚期的巴洛克城镇瓦拉迪那托（西西里东南部）",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Late Baroque Towns of the Val di Noto (South-Eastern Sicily)",
 "name_local": "Città tardo barocche del Val di Noto",
